[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "title": "Latest WoW Forever Beta Priest Class Changes 10/15",
    "category": "Priest News",
    "author": "Lawrentiueus",
    "date": "Oct 17, 2026",
    "imageUrl": "",
    "summary": "The latest WoW Forever Beta patch brings significant class updates for Priests. Highlights include major cooldown changes for Devouring Plague and Vampiric Embrace, talent tree reshuffling across Discipline and Shadow, key bug fixes, and the brand-new party Spirit buffing talent: Dark Inspiration.",
    "content": "<h2>General Priest Changes</h2><h3>Spell Adjustments &amp; Quality of Life</h3><ul><li><span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_holy_renew.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><strong><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=139/renew'>Renew</a>:</strong></span> Fixed an issue where high ranks of Renew were preventing other Priests from applying Renew to the target.</li><li><span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_fire_incinerate.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><strong><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=14914/holy-fire'>Holy Fire</a>:</strong></span> Fixed an issue causing Rank 5 periodic damage to be higher than Rank 6.</li><li><span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_holy_powerwordshield.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><strong><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=17/power-word-shield'>Power Word: Shield</a>:</strong></span> Will now correctly tell the player they can’t replace a Power Word: Shield on a target if the active shield is stronger.</li><li><span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_holy_powerwordshield.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><strong><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=17/power-word-shield'>Power Word: Shield</a>:</strong></span> Fixed an issue where casting Power Word: Shield would say <em>SHIELDED</em> twice in scrolling combat text.</li><li><span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_holy_mindvision.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><strong><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=605/mind-vision'>Mind Vision</a>:</strong></span> Fixed an issue where casting Mind Vision would cause the target to stand up and interrupt drinks.</li></ul><h3>Cooldown Updates</h3><ul><li><span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_shadow_devouringplague.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><strong><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=2944/devouring-plague'>Devouring Plague</a>:</strong></span> Cooldown reduced to <mark>24 seconds</mark> (was 1 minute).</li><li><span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_shadow_siphonmana.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><strong><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=32379/shadow-word-death'>Shadow Word: Death</a>:</strong></span> Cooldown increased to <mark>18 seconds</mark> (was 12 seconds).</li></ul><h2>Discipline Tree Changes</h2><h3>Ability Mechanics &amp; Tooltips</h3><ul><li><span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_frost_windwalkonwill.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><strong><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=14751/inner-focus'>Inner Focus</a>:</strong></span> Will now correctly only be used on a single spell, even if you spell queue another spell into Penance’s channel.</li><li><span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_priest_divineaegis.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><strong><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=47753/divine-aegis'>Divine Aegis</a>:</strong></span> Tooltip explicitly updated to state that it is activated by <em>Non-Periodic critical heals</em>.</li><li><span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_priest_divineaegis.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><strong><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=47753/divine-aegis'>Divine Aegis</a>:</strong></span> Tooltip now explicitly lists the maximum value for the shield.</li><li><strong>Power in Light:</strong> Now increases <span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_holy_holynova.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=585/smite'>Smite</a></span> and <span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_holy_penance.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=47540/penance'>Penance</a></span> if the target is afflicted by <span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_fire_incinerate.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=14914/holy-fire'>Holy Fire</a></span> or <span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_shadow_shadowwordpain.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=589/shadow-word-pain'>Shadow Word: Pain</a></span>.</li><li><strong>Silent Resolve:</strong> Threat reduction now applies to all spells.</li></ul><h3>Talent Tree Reshuffling</h3><ul><li><strong>Mental Strength:</strong> Moved to <mark>Row 2</mark> from Row 4. Changed to increase your Intellect by <mark>2/4/6/8/10%</mark>.</li><li><strong>Improved Power Word: Shield:</strong> Moved to <mark>Row 3</mark> from Row 2.</li><li><strong>Twin Disciplines:</strong> Now correctly benefits <span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_shadow_siphonmana.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=32379/shadow-word-death'>Shadow Word: Death</a></span>, <span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_shadow_mindflay.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=15407/mind-flay'>Mind Flay</a></span>, Starshards, and <span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_holy_penance.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=47540/penance'>Penance</a></span>.</li></ul><h2>Shadow Tree Changes</h2><h3>Bug Fixes &amp; Core Adjustments</h3><ul><li><span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_shadow_siphonmana.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><strong><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=32379/shadow-word-death'>Shadow Word: Death</a>:</strong></span> Fixed an issue where it was not benefitting from Shadowform’s increase to critical strike damage.</li><li><strong>Devouring Contagion:</strong> Fixed an issue where the bounced <span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_shadow_devouringplague.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=2944/devouring-plague'>Devouring Plague</a></span> was costing Mana, performing a cast animation, and putting the caster’s Devouring Plague back on full cooldown.</li><li><span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_shadow_vampiricembrace.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><strong><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=15286/vampiric-embrace'>Vampiric Embrace</a>:</strong></span> Changed so that it <mark>can’t be resisted</mark>. Cooldown reduced to <mark>30 seconds</mark> (was 1 minute).</li><li><span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_shadow_blackplague.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><strong><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=15258/shadow-weaving'>Shadow Weaving</a>:</strong></span> Tooltip fixed to correctly state that it causes the target to take increased damage from you.</li></ul><h3>Talent Reworks &amp; New Additions</h3><ul><li><mark>NEW TALENT</mark> <span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_shadow_psychicscream.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><strong>Dark Inspiration (Row 4):</strong></span> Your <span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_shadow_unholyfrenzy.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=25399/mind-blast'>Mind Blast</a></span> and fully channeled <span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_shadow_mindflay.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=15407/mind-flay'>Mind Flay</a></span> cause Dark Inspiration, increasing yours and your party’s Spirit by <mark>3/6/9/12/15% for 10 seconds</mark>.</li><li><strong>Improved Mind Flay:</strong> Changed to, each instance of damage of <span style='display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;'><img src='https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/spell_shadow_mindflay.jpg' width='18' height='18' style='border-radius:3px;' /><a href='https://www.wowhead.com/spell=15407/mind-flay'>Mind Flay</a></span> deals <mark>10/20% more damage</mark> than its previous instance of damage.</li><li><strong>Devouring Contagion:</strong> Now spreads to <mark>2 targets</mark>.</li><li><strong>Improved Mind Blast:</strong> Moved from <mark>Row 3 to Row 2</mark>.</li><li><mark>REMOVED</mark> <strong>Improved Fade:</strong> Removed from the talent tree.</li><li><mark>REMOVED</mark> <strong>Shadow Infinity:</strong> Removed from the talent tree.</li></ul>"
  }
]
